WEBVTT

00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:05.079
Product Overview shows where you win and lose, by product.

00:00:05.079 --> 00:00:07.479
The portfolio shows won, lost,

00:00:07.479 --> 00:00:12.979
open and past-due value for every family, line and product.

00:00:13.041 --> 00:00:16.201
Needs help flags a product that lost more than it won,

00:00:16.361 --> 00:00:18.483
with enough closed deals to count.

00:00:18.483 --> 00:00:22.751
Click it to see the lost deals, and the reason each one recorded.

00:00:22.751 --> 00:00:27.271
Then find out why, and put training and sales material where it’s needed.
